  "description": "The 700c Vitesse™ Signal is a hybrid electric bicycle designed to elevate your riding experience. The lightweight aluminum frame with an integrated 36V battery is sleek and weather resistant. Equipped with a ZOOM front suspension fork providing 40mm of travel, the Vitesse™ Signal ensures a smooth and comfortable ride on various terrains. The 250-watt rear hub motor delivers seamless pedal-assisted power, engaging when you pedal and stopping when you do. The LED display controller allows you to easily manage speed settings and monitor battery levels. With Alloy V-Brakes, the Vitesse™ Signal ensures reliable stopping power. The 8-speed drivetrain is equipped with easy to use thumb shifters and a ProWheel aluminum crank, enhancing your riding efficiency. Enjoy an impressive electric-assisted range of up to 40 miles on a single charge, with up to 6 hours of riding time before needing to recharge. The battery charges from 0-100% in just 4-6 hours and has a lifespan of up to 1000 charge cycles. Embrace the future of cycling with the 700c Vitesse™ Signal.",
